  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4646,
      "text": "We have created man and know what his soul whispers within him, for We are closer to him than his jugular vein[8].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4647,
      "text": "When the two angel scribes, constantly accompanying him[9], one on the right, and the other on the left[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4648,
      "text": "Not a single word he utters but there is with him a vigilant watcher, ready [to record it].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4649,
      "text": "The throes of death will come with the truth[11]. This is what you were trying to avoid.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4650,
      "text": "And the Trumpet will be blown[12]; that is the Day of [the given] warning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4651,
      "text": "Everyone will come, accompanied by an angel to drive him and another to testify[13].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4652,
      "text": "“You were heedless of this; now We have removed your veil[14], so your vision is sharp Today.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4653,
      "text": "His angel-companion will say, “Here is the record ready with me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4654,
      "text": "[It will be said to the two angels], “Throw into Hell every obstinate disbeliever,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4655,
      "text": "every withholder of good, transgressor, and doubter,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4656,
      "text": "who set up with Allah another god. Throw him into the severe punishment.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 207,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4657,
      "text": "His [devil] companion will say, “Our Lord, I did not mislead him, but he himself was far astray.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4658,
      "text": "Allah will say, “Do not argue in My presence, for I had already given you the warning.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4659,
      "text": "My Word cannot be changed, nor am I unjust to My slaves.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 453,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4660,
      "text": "[Beware of] the Day when We will say to Hell, “Have you reached your fill?” It will say, “Are there any more?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4661,
      "text": "Paradise will be brought near to the righteous, not far off.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4662,
      "text": "[It will be said], “This is what you were promised; this is for everyone who constantly turned [to Allah] and was dutiful,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4663,
      "text": "who feared the Most Compassionate unseen[15], and came with a devoted heart.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4664,
      "text": "Enter it in peace. This is the Day of eternity.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 519,
      "ruku": 454,
      "hizbQuarter": 208,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4665,
      "text": "They will have therein all what they wish for, and We have yet more[16].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 50,
        "name": "سُورَةُ قٓ",
        "englishName": "Qaaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The letter Qaaf",
        "numberOfAyahs": 45,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 26,
      "manzil": 7,
